WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.320
Today is the day you've done the hard part. A few final reminders before you

2
00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:04.640
head in.

3
00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:09.670
Stop all clear liquids at least four hours before your procedure time.

4
00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:10.800
Nothing to drink after that

5
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:16.630
point, including water. Continue to avoid solid foods and alcohol. Avoid hard

6
00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:18.080
candy, gum, and mints.

7
00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:23.020
These count as food and can affect your sedation. Take a moment to confirm that

8
00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:23.760
your output has

9
00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:27.920
been running clear. That's the sign that your prep has done its job. If you're

10
00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:28.640
not there yet,

11
00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:32.150
please contact your doctor's office before coming in. Lastly, your driver

12
00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:33.120
should also be ready to go.

13
00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:37.360
Your doctor is looking forward to seeing you and taking great care of you today

14
00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:38.480
.
